<p>Israeli forces carried out an overnight airborne raid in Lebanon’s eastern Bekaa Valley, targeting the village of Nabi Sheet/Nabi Chit, as part of a renewed effort to locate the remains of Ron Arad, an Israeli air force navigator missing for decades. Lebanese health authorities said at least 41 people were killed and around 40 injured during the operation and the clashes that followed, as residents described intense violence and widespread damage. Israel’s military said the mission did not recover any findings related to Arad. The raid came as the Israel–Hezbollah conflict sharply escalated: Israel also struck Beirut and warned Lebanon it would pay a “heavy price” if its government does not act against Hezbollah, while Hezbollah has continued attacks on Israel across the border.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/U2yNgVt9iPWskDWYSPk5mjyCoBlung54V0eEdsSM_pe0TJ8hfac_QhNAvoWy-y3oyqRl6Y5RCaK53HuRyV-AhzoK_OiDGJ7xXNPaE61iQMSZtVBWee-OROuFR77cGAcGNKd7NQELM5TtvzhH4oUbCvOHh9ZXyxQ58NEcp32YesygAaDE7II4jQ96pqiUVkDWwi-5Y8HbDNIaX8FIeJ_Yqbao9ScI_9ketV3DEpuzL51iWjI-OU0KrY6tcR_Jzlh_I64ezlJMRALn9mQyMg' alt='An overturned car sits on the 4th floor of a damaged building after a missile strike in Nabi Chit in Lebanon’s Beqaa Valley, March 7, 2026.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Rare insertion: Reports described Israeli helicopters flying troops deep into the Bekaa Valley in an unusually direct airborne ground operation, rather than relying only on stand-off strikes.</li><li>Graves disturbed: Al Jazeera said Israeli forces dug up graves during the raid while searching for the missing airman.</li><li>Beirut strikes: Separate from the Bekaa raid, Israeli airstrikes hit Beirut’s southern suburbs after evacuation orders, leaving damaged buildings and streets covered in rubble, according to Reuters video cited by Dawn.</li><li>No territorial claims: In a warning to Lebanon’s President Joseph Aoun, Israel’s defence minister said Israel has no territorial claims against Lebanon, while threatening severe consequences if Beirut does not act against Hezbollah.</li><li>Regional trigger: The Hindu linked Lebanon’s deeper involvement to cross-border exchanges that intensified after Hezbollah launched rockets and drones into Israel.</li></ul><blockquote>If the choice is between protecting our civilians and our soldiers, or protecting the state of Lebanon, we will choose the protection of our civilians and soldiers — and the Lebanese government and Lebanon will pay a very heavy price - Israel Katz</blockquote><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Israel Defense Minister Israel Katz: In a statement addressed to Lebanon’s President Joseph Aoun, he warned Lebanon would pay a “very heavy price” if it fails to curb Hezbollah fire from its territory, while also saying Israel has no territorial claims against Lebanon. (<a href='https://www.dawn.com/news/1979644/israel-pounds-beirut-warns-lebanon-of-heavy-price'>Dawn</a>)</li><li>Israeli military: It said troops carried out the Bekaa Valley operation to search for Ron Arad’s remains, but found nothing linked to him. (<a href='https://www.ndtv.com/world-news/nabi-sheet-israels-failed-op-to-find-body-of-pilot-ron-arad-missing-since-1986-kills-41-in-lebanon-11184524#publisher=newsstand'>NDTV</a>)</li><li>Lebanese Health Ministry: It said dozens of people were killed and injured in and around Nabi Sheet after the overnight raid and clashes. (<a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/cy8l2p2l3v0o'>BBC</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.ndtv.com/world-news/nabi-sheet-israels-failed-op-to-find-body-of-pilot-ron-arad-missing-since-1986-kills-41-in-lebanon-11184524#publisher=newsstand'>Israel&#x27;s Failed Lebanon Op To Find Body Of Pilot Missing Since 1986 Kills 41</a> - ndtv.com</li><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/several-people-killed-in-israeli-airborne-raid-in-lebanon/article70716769.ece'>At least 40 killed in Israeli airborne raid in Lebanon</a> - thehindu.com</li><li><